 "unstated_details": [
  "star = played the team's previous game AND (prior-10 pts >= 20 incl. that game, min 5 games, OR top-3 prior-10 minutes among the team's players of that game); the descriptive tables' definition (data/scratch/fan_answers_2026-10-11.py); a player who missed the previous game is not a star row",
  "team rate unit: each prior b2b second-night team game contributes the share of its star opportunities who sat (traded-away players excluded); rate = (sum + 20*L) / (n_b2b + 20), L = league mean of that share over all b2b games strictly before the date; defined only if n_b2b >= 10 inside the 82-game window (frozen amendment), else the row takes L (counted)",
  "the 82-game window is over all team games (playoffs included), crossing seasons",
  "is_b2b_second = previous team game was yesterday; the model gets star and b2b_star (b2b itself is already a P1 feature); agreement with P1's b2b column is reported",
  "strength tercile = prior-season regular-season win% rank among 30 teams (ties by team_id), 2 = contender; 2022's comes from data/history 2021-22; tag code unlisted 0, available 1, probable 2, questionable 3, doubtful 4 (null when the game has no such snapshot)",
  "morning = earliest same-day snapshot stamped before 15:00 ET (usable under the real-tip gate); evening = latest snapshot stamped on the previous calendar day; a game with no such snapshot gets null, never 'nobody listed'",
  "placebo P3 permutes team_b2b_sit across team-games within season (seed 0)",
  "P0 is reported against both p_platt (the draft's P0) and p_raw (reference only)"
 ],
